          <rules>
            <rule name="Sojutsu Pattern Voidbike" id="df8e-76c1-925f-f9d4" hidden="false">
              <description>Falls Back 3D6&quot; instead of 2D6&quot;.
May join units that include models with the Cavalry Unit Type despite the usual restrictions, and any rules that target the Cavalry Unit Type are considered to affect Jaghatai Khan as if he had that type.

If Jaghatai Khan selected his Sojutsu Pattern Voidbike, he is counted as having a Legion Scimitar Jetbike for rules and interactions that affect or require that wargear.

Note that even though Jaghatai Khan is counted as having the Cavalry Unit Type whilst upgraded to have a Sojutsu Pattern Voidbike for the purposes of any Rules, he cannot be affected by Narthecium Wargear.”</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
